[{"id":3691436949,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7cBtuV","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"bbcbbd91fbdbdf72d2ac5e5fc6fab2b745890c7a","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115240#pullrequestreview-3691436949","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115240","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T09:21:36Z"},{"id":3693314246,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7cI4DG","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"bbcbbd91fbdbdf72d2ac5e5fc6fab2b745890c7a","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8116516?u=7e6db9ae618f9cc3736b728522698935c7ef51aa&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/xhocquet","id":8116516,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTY1MTY=","login":"xhocquet","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115240#pullrequestreview-3693314246","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115240","author_association":"NONE","submitted_at":"2026-01-22T16:15:26Z"},{"id":3695234735,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7cQM6v","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"f078c5729e464596d4d3824f861d5f6f2d26c8c9","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it still causes dozens of errors to be printed when loading a scene with ReflectionProbes:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Condition \"format.mipmaps < 1\" is true. Returning: RID()\r\n   at: texture_create (./servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:932)\r\nERROR: Attempted to name invalid ID: 0\r\n   at: set_resource_name (./servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:6472)\r\n```\r\n\r\nHowever, it no longer crashes in both Forward+ and Mobile.\r\n\r\nAlso, visually, it looks pretty odd on ReflectionProbes as things will remain reflective even with `roughness = 1.0`:\r\n\r\n### 1 roughness layer\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/98bfbd4a-e0e4-4a34-9d1c-92cb3ea1d220\r\n\r\n### 2 roughness layers\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/97384190-b160-4ca9-b860-ef52b1f1046e\r\n\r\n### 7 roughness layers (default)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09ae8d9f-bc26-4fb5-9c4f-bcf59dd759dc\r\n\r\nIt gets even worse with ambient light from reflection probes (not shown in the above videos, as I'm using LightmapGI):\r\n\r\n1 roughness layer | 2 roughness layers | 7 roughness layers\r\n-|-|-\r\n<img width=\"1180\" height=\"783\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91eaa2d8-fed5-4704-9020-3b9dc06645a3\" /> | <img width=\"1180\" height=\"783\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1ecb873d-4993-4140-ba52-2d7081966afb\" /> | <img width=\"1180\" height=\"783\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/27531fe6-30ca-4a13-9bb8-fb62635dd9ec\" />\r\n\r\nWe may want to clamp the lowest number of roughness layers to 2 to avoid this. To do, we'd modify the project settings hint, but also clamp in the RenderingServer setter in case an old project set it to `1`.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115240#pullrequestreview-3695234735","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115240","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-01-23T00:42:17Z"},{"id":3699338935,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7cf263","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"e7094dd8fe7afbc8db39e35e04ca5db8cc369e86","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115240#pullrequestreview-3699338935","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115240","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-01-23T19:52:26Z"},{"id":3700372300,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7cjzNM","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"e7094dd8fe7afbc8db39e35e04ca5db8cc369e86","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8116516?u=7e6db9ae618f9cc3736b728522698935c7ef51aa&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/xhocquet","id":8116516,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTY1MTY=","login":"xhocquet","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/xhocquet"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/1